
### Project Service API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5004
@candidateId = 1
@resumeId = 1
@projectId = 1

### 1. Add completed project
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/projects
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Job Portal Backend",
  "description": "Microservices-based job portal built with Java 21 and Spring Boot",
  "technologies": [
    "Java 21",
    "Spring Boot",
    "PostgreSQL",
    "Docker",
    "Flyway"
  ],
  "projectUrl": "https://jobportal.example.com",
  "sourceCodeUrl": "https://github.com/example/job-portal",
  "startDate": "2025-01-01",
  "endDate": "2025-10-01",
  "isonGoeing": false,
  "displayOrder": 1
}

### 2. Add ongoing project
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/projects
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Resume Builder",
  "description": "Online resume management and portfolio builder",
  "technologies": [
    "Java",
    "Spring Boot",
    "REST APIs",
    "PostgreSQL"
  ],
  "projectUrl": "https://resume.example.com",
  "sourceCodeUrl": "https://github.com/example/resume-builder",
  "startDate": "2026-01-01",
  "endDate": null,
  "isonGoeing": true,
  "displayOrder": 2
}

### 3. Get all projects for a resume
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/projects

### 4. Update project
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/projects/{{projectId}}
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Job Portal Microservices System",
  "description": "Updated job portal with resume management",
  "technologies": [
    "Java 21",
    "Spring Boot",
    "PostgreSQL",
    "Docker",
    "Flyway",
    "Spring Data JPA"
  ],
  "projectUrl": "https://jobportal.example.com",
  "sourceCodeUrl": "https://github.com/example/job-portal",
  "startDate": "2025-01-01",
  "endDate": "2025-10-01",
  "isonGoeing": false,
  "displayOrder": 1
}

### 5. Delete project
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/projects/{{projectId}}
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}
